title: 'Recover under-backed reserves on Asset Hub Westend'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Follow-up to #13717. `pallet-balances` adds `Pallet::reserved_shortfall`, a `try_state` check
    for accounts whose holds and named reserves exceed their reserved balance, and the
    `migration::RebackReserved` migration, which moves the shortfall of the listed accounts from
    free to reserved. Asset Hub Westend runs it once for the four affected accounts.
crates:
- name: pallet-balances
  bump: minor
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: minor
